{%- comment -%}
  Solarmanager — TRMNL Plugin Markup (Basis-Version)
  Einfügen unter: Plugin → Markup (Full)

  Erwartet die JSON-Antwort von GET /v2/point als Polling-Response:
  { pW, cW, bcW, bdW, devices: [...], t, ... }

  Die Wärmepumpe/der Boiler wird dynamisch erkannt (erstes Device mit
  "temperature"-Feld), nicht über eine feste Array-Position — das bleibt
  auch stabil, wenn sich die Geräte-Reihenfolge am Gateway mal ändert.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign pv = pW | default: 0 -%}
{%- assign consumption = cW | default: 0 -%}
{%- assign batt_charge = bcW | default: 0 -%}
{%- assign batt_discharge = bdW | default: 0 -%}
{%- assign grid = consumption | plus: batt_charge | minus: pv | minus: batt_discharge -%}
{%- assign grid_abs = grid | abs -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Webhook-Modus: das Skript liefert "heatpump" direkt.
  Polling-Modus: "heatpump" fehlt, dann wird es im devices-Array gesucht.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if heatpump == nil -%}
  {%- for d in devices -%}
    {%- if d.temperature and heatpump == nil -%}
      {%- assign heatpump = d -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}

<div class="view view--full">
  <div class="layout layout--col gap--large">

    <div class="columns">
      <div class="column">
        <span class="label">PV-Leistung</span>
        <span class="value value--xlarge">{{ pv | round }}<span class="value--unit">W</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="column">
        <span class="label">Hausverbrauch</span>
        <span class="value value--xlarge">{{ consumption | round }}<span class="value--unit">W</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="columns">
      <div class="column">
        <span class="label">Netz</span>
        <span class="value value--large">{{ grid_abs | round }}<span class="value--unit">W</span></span>
        <span class="description">{% if grid >= 0 %}Bezug{% else %}Einspeisung{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="column">
        <span class="label">Batterie</span>
        {% if batt_charge > 0 %}
          <span class="value value--large">+{{ batt_charge | round }}<span class="value--unit">W</span></span>
          <span class="description">laden</span>
        {% elsif batt_discharge > 0 %}
          <span class="value value--large">-{{ batt_discharge | round }}<span class="value--unit">W</span></span>
          <span class="description">entladen</span>
        {% else %}
          <span class="value value--large">–</span>
          <span class="description">Standby</span>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if heatpump %}
    <div class="columns">
      <div class="column">
        <span class="label">{{ heizung_label | default: "Wärmepumpe" }}</span>
        <span class="value value--large">{{ heatpump.temperature | round: 1 }}<span class="value--unit">°C</span></span>
        <span class="description">
          {% if heatpump.activeDevice == 1 %}aktiv{% else %}inaktiv{% endif %}
          {% if heatpump.signal != "connected" %} · getrennt{% endif %}
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

  </div>

  <div class="title_bar">
    <span class="title">Solarmanager</span>
    <span class="instance">{{ t }}</span>
  </div>
</div>
